  "definition": "Reporting",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-04-20",
  "historyNote": "#5792, eff 2-24-94; ss by #7199, INTERIM, eff 2-24-00, EXPIRES: 6-23-00; ss and moved by #7219, eff 3-29-00 (from Saf-C 4303.01), EXPIRED: 3-29-08 New. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11; ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
